vendor/xz/xz-embedded.mjs is the WebAssembly module of xz-decompress 0.2.3
(https://github.com/httptoolkit/xz-decompress), extracted unchanged and base64-encoded.

It contains:
- XZ Embedded by Lasse Collin and Igor Pavlov — public domain (https://tukaani.org/xz/embedded.html).
- walloc, Copyright (c) 2020 Igalia, S.L. — MIT License (https://github.com/wingo/walloc).
- xzwasm, Copyright (c) Steve Sanderson — MIT License (https://github.com/SteveSanderson/xzwasm),
  and its fork xz-decompress, Copyright (c) Tim Perry — MIT License.

